%% VisionSystem 增量：本机摄像头 + 流程编排 —— 时序图
%% 场景一：打开本机摄像头并实时预览
%% 场景二：编排流程（新建→拖入→连线→绑定→执行→结果显示）

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户
    participant CF as CameraForm
    participant CM as CameraManager
    participant LC as LocalCamera
    participant NC as NativeCamera(P/Invoke)
    participant CPP as VisionAlgo.Native(va_camera)
    participant CV as OpenCV VideoCapture
    participant IV as ImageViewer

    rect rgb(36,44,54)
    Note over U,IV: 场景一：打开本机摄像头并实时预览
    U->>CF: 点「刷新列表」
    CF->>CM: Enumerate()
    CM->>LC: Enumerate() (静态)
    LC->>NC: va_camera_enum(&count)
    NC->>CPP: va_camera_enum
    CPP->>CV: 逐个 DShow open/isOpened/release
    CPP-->>NC: count
    NC-->>LC: count
    LC-->>CM: List<CameraInfo>("USB-i")
    CM-->>CF: [本机..., 模拟, 海康...]
    CF-->>U: 列表刷新([本机]/[模拟] 前缀)

    U->>CF: 选中本机摄像头，点「打开」
    CF->>CM: Open("USB-0")
    CM->>LC: new LocalCamera(0) -> Open()
    LC->>NC: va_camera_open(0, opt)
    NC->>CPP: va_camera_open
    CPP->>CV: VideoCapture(0, MSMF) and set(W/H/FPS)
    alt 打开成功
        CPP-->>NC: handle
        LC->>NC: va_camera_get_size()
        NC-->>LC: w,h -> Info.Model="1280x720"
        LC-->>CM: OpResult.Ok
    else 被占用/拔除
        CPP-->>NC: NULL (VA_ERR_CAMERA)
        LC-->>CM: OpResult.Fail(LastError)
    end
    CM-->>CF: OpResult<ICamera>
    CF->>LC: FrameReceived += OnFrame

    U->>CF: 点「开始采集」
    CF->>LC: StartGrab()
    LC->>LC: 启动采集线程 GrabLoop
    loop 每帧
        LC->>NC: va_camera_grab(handle, VA_Image(dst BGR), timeout)
        NC->>CPP: va_camera_grab (CopyOut cv::Mat to dst)
        CPP-->>LC: VA_OK
        LC->>LC: 新 Bitmap(24bpp) 填充，触发 FrameReceived
        LC-->>CF: FrameReceived(frame)
        CF->>CF: BeginInvoke(切 UI 线程)
        CF->>IV: SetImage(frame, false)
    end
    U->>CF: 点「停止采集」
    CF->>LC: StopGrab() (stopFlag + Join)
    end

    participant FF as FlowForm
    participant FC as FlowCanvasControl
    participant FM as FlowModule
    participant CS as ConfigStore
    participant FR as FlowRunner
    participant OC as FlowOutputChannel
    participant MF as MainForm

    rect rgb(44,40,54)
    Note over U,MF: 场景二：编排流程（新建->拖入->连线->绑定->执行->结果显示）
    U->>FF: 点「新建流程」
    FF->>CS: Flows.Add(FlowDefinition.CreateEmpty("流程 N"))
    FF->>CS: ActiveFlowId = 新Id; Save()
    FF->>FC: Flow = 新流程（画布清空）

    U->>FC: 从工具箱拖「形状匹配」到画布
    FC->>FM: 取模块默认参数
    FC->>FC: 落点创建 FlowNode(Type="ShapeMatch")
    FC-->>FF: NodeAdded(node)
    FF->>CS: 写回流程; Save()

    U->>FC: 从节点输出口拖到另一节点输入口
    FC->>FC: 建立 FlowLink
    FC-->>FF: LinkAdded(link)
    FF->>CS: Save()

    U->>FF: 选中节点 -> 右侧改「最小得分」
    FF->>CS: node.Set("minScore","0.75"); Save()

    U->>FF: 绑定 显示窗口=视图3 / 相机=USB-0
    FF->>CS: flow.ViewIndex=3; flow.CameraId="USB-0"; Save()

    U->>FF: 点「运行」
    FF->>FF: 校验单链（无成环/断链）
    FF->>FR: Run(flow, CameraManager["USB-0"])
    FR->>LC: GrabOne()（图像源节点）
    LC-->>FR: frame
    FR->>FR: 形状匹配（自建 VisionAlgo 上下文）
    FR-->>OC: Publish(FlowOutputEventArgs{ViewIndex=3, frame, shapes, passed})
    OC-->>MF: OutputReady 事件
    MF->>MF: BeginInvoke，ShowFrame(2, "USB-0", frame)
    MF->>MF: ClearShapes + 叠加 shapes + Shapes.NotifyChanged()
    MF-->>U: 视图3 显示流程结果
    end
